#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0247 expect=skipped domain=TA
#note "FRESH. DELIBERATELY NO TAETORD COLUMN. Requirements.Variables.All [TAETORD] rejects the dataset, so the rule SKIPS. THIS IS HALF OF THE BATCH'S SHARPEST CONTRAST PAIR - read it against CDISC-CG0268-invalid_tsseq_column_absent-TS, where the SAME operator with an absent target FIRES because that rule declares no Requirements.Variables. Same operator, same absence, opposite verdicts, both correct. Do not 'fix' either toward the other."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset TA class="TRIAL DESIGN"
col STUDYID type=Char
col DOMAIN  type=Char
col ARMCD   type=Char
col ARM     type=Char
col ETCD    type=Char label="Element Code"
---
S1 | TA | A | Arm A | SCRN
S1 | TA | A | Arm A | TRT
